description=Performance + GPU tweaks for POCO F7 (onyx, SD 8s Gen 4). Forces full-resolution render (disables GameManager downscaling) and performance game mode for Fortnite and other popular games, plus light I/O/VM tuning. For AOSP / LineageOS / AxionAOSP.
